<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Asahimas says 1996 net down.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Asahimas says 1996 net down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales				    347.29  vs  403.60</p>
<p>    Gross profit				 124.83  vs  190.27</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   53.87  vs   84.49</p>
<p>    Net profit				    44.07  vs   73.71</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rph)		 102  vs     208</p>
<p>    Total assets				 731.60  vs  740.10</p>
<p>Note : Full name PT Asahimas Flat Glass Co Ltd. The results were audited.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
